      <title>Oh captain, our captain: Ars staff remembers Patrick Stewart</title>
      <author>
                    Jennifer Ouellette
                </author>
      <link>https://arstechnica.com/culture/2026/10/oh-captain-our-captain-ars-staff-remembers-patrick-stewart/</link>
      <comments>https://arstechnica.com/culture/2026/10/oh-captain-our-captain-ars-staff-remembers-patrick-stewart/#comments</comments>
